    "ttft_ms": "Time from request issue to the first streamed token, observed by this client. The clock starts after a concurrency slot is acquired.",
    "itl_ms": "Gaps between consecutive streamed tokens, pooled across successful measured requests. The first token is TTFT and is not an inter-token gap. Requests with one token contribute no inter-token samples.",
